body:json {
  {
    "proposal": "APPROVED_PROPOSAL_UUID",
    "note": "Looking forward to working together!"
  }
}

docs {
  ## Create Job Order — Authenticated

  Creates a new Job order from an approved proposal.
  The order and chat room are created atomically.
  No escrow is created for job orders.

  Replace `APPROVED_PROPOSAL_UUID` with an actual approved proposal ID.

  ### Success Response (201)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Job order created successfully",
    "data": {
      "id": "...",
      "code": "JB-260706-592m",
      "source": "JOB",
      "status": "PENDING"
    }
  }
  ```
}
